sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User<br/>(CLI / Python API)
    participant THub as Training Hub<br/>Library
    participant Registry as AlgorithmRegistry
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Backend as Training Backend<br/>(torchrun workers)
    participant NCCL as NCCL<br/>(GPU-direct)
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>(checkpoints)
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant LLM as OpenAI-Compatible API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 1: SFT / OSFT Training
        User->>THub: sft() / osft() / thub sft
        THub->>Registry: resolve algorithm + backend
        Registry-->>THub: InstructLabTrainingSFTBackend / MiniTrainerOSFTBackend
        THub->>HF: Download model & dataset<br/>HTTPS, HF_TOKEN (optional)
        HF-->>THub: Model artifacts
        THub->>Backend: Launch torchrun workers
        Backend->>NCCL: Distributed weight sync<br/>(GPU-direct)
        Backend->>FS: Save checkpoints
        THub->>S3: Mirror checkpoint (background LIFO)<br/>HTTPS, AWS credentials
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 2: GRPO Training (verl backend)
        User->>THub: lora_grpo(backend="verl") / thub lora-grpo
        THub->>Registry: resolve algorithm + backend
        Registry-->>THub: VeRLLoRAGRPOBackend
        THub->>Backend: Launch torchrun + Hydra CLI
        Note over Backend: verl workers: vLLM rollout<br/>generation + FSDP weight sync
        Backend->>NCCL: FSDP distributed sync<br/>(GPU-direct)
        Backend->>FS: Save checkpoints
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over User,LLM: Flow 3: GEPA Prompt Optimization
        User->>THub: gepa() / thub gepa
        THub->>Registry: resolve algorithm + backend
        Registry-->>THub: GEPABackend
        loop Evolutionary search iterations
            THub->>LLM: Prompt evaluation via litellm<br/>HTTPS, OPENAI_API_KEY
            LLM-->>THub: LLM response + scoring
        end
        THub->>FS: Save optimized prompt
    end
